CRITICAL · Add the missing load-on-open useEffect to AssignmentCreateDrawer.jsx, immediately AFTER the reset-on-open effect (~line 361). Suggested code:

  // iter438 · Pass C · hydrate pendingDraft from localStorage when the drawer opens.
  // Sequencing note: this MUST run after the reset-on-open effect so the form is
  // pristine before we ask the user whether to restore.
  useEffect(() => {
    if (!open) return;
    setPendingDraft(_readDraft());
  }, [open, _readDraft]);

Without this, _readDraft is dead code and the restore prompt is structurally unreachable.
